<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">MY ACCOUNT</view><view class="title">余额与记录</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在加载…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<button class="secondary" bindtap="retry">重试</button></view><view wx:if="{{ready}}"><view class="card"><view class="muted">可用本金余额 · 无赠送金额</view><view class="amount">¥ {{balance}}</view><view>{{tier}} · 演示履约累计 ¥{{fulfilled}}</view><view class="rule">等级升级时点待定；当前仅演示按已完成服务实付价值累计。充值、购卡、核销分别记账，不重复算消费。</view></view><view class="heading section">账户流水</view><view wx:for="{{ledger}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view>{{item.kindText}}</view><view>¥ {{item.amountText}}</view></view><view class="small muted">{{item.note}}</view></view><view class="card"><view class="heading">独立储值本金退款</view><view class="rule">仅申请与人工登记。批准后本金预留，状态明确“未付款”；不执行真实资金转账。</view><input class="field" type="digit" data-field="refundAmount" value="{{refundAmount}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="申请退还的本金（元）"/><textarea class="field" data-field="evidence" bindinput="input" value="{{evidence}}" maxlength="500" placeholder="原因与说明"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="requestRefund" disabled="{{busy}}">提交本金退款申请</button></view><view wx:for="{{refunds}}" wx:key="id" class="card">¥{{item.amountText}} · {{item.statusText}}</view></view></view>
